  "body": "Imagine living right in the heart of Takapuna, with no body corporate fees to pay. This central two bedroom brick and tile unit offers you a winning combination of lifestyle, location, and convenience, just 400 metres from Lake Pupuke and 750 metres from Takapuna Beach.\r\n\r\nIt's not often that truly affordable properties reach the market in the beautiful seaside suburb of Takapuna, and well maintained, low maintenance brick units in this incredibly convenient pocket are always in demand. Here's your chance to secure one.\r\n\r\nEverything central Takapuna has to offer is within walking distance: \r\n\r\nPop to the Shore City Shopping Centre, New World, or Woolworths, enjoy a swim at the local pool, or catch a movie at the cinema. Keep active at the wide range of gyms on offer, explore nearby cafés and restaurants, or simply relax by the beach or lake.\r\n\r\nTop School Zones\r\n\r\nIdeal for families and for securing long term property value, your new home is surrounded by highly sought after educational options:\r\n\r\nTakapuna Primary School\r\nTakapuna Normal Intermediate (IB curriculum)\r\nWestlake Girls High School\r\nTakapuna Grammar School (IB offered)\r\n\r\nNearby Catholic schools include St Joseph's Catholic School, Rosmini College, and Carmel College.\r\n\r\nOn a wide variety of bus routes taking you all over the North Shore and to the city centre, quick motorway access means efficient travel across Auckland. \r\n\r\nThe House Itself:\r\n\r\nA practical, well appointed two bedroom, one bathroom layout designed for easy modern living. You'll enjoy two good sized bedrooms, while the neutral décor will complement any style or era of furnishing. Multiple parking spaces plus a spacious enclosed garage. Perfect for extra storage or other purposes, this large garage is a great feature. \r\n\r\nEnjoy premium North Shore living right at your fingertips!\r\n\r\nAct now. Call today to book a private viewing.\r\n\r\nTo view this property, contact owner/representative(s): Iris - Phone: 0274816068.",
